<StaticPageLayout
  title="About LUDIVON"
  eyebrow="ABOUT"
  description="Learn what LUDIVON publishes, who it serves and what readers can expect from its gaming and technology guides."
>
  <h2>What is LUDIVON?</h2>

  <p>
    LUDIVON is an independent gaming and technology publication
    focused on practical guidance that helps readers understand
    their devices, make informed choices and get more from gaming.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our tagline is simple:
    <strong>Understand your tech. Play smarter.</strong>
  </p>

  <p>
    LUDIVON is an independent publication from TGG HUB.
  </p>

  <h2>Who we write for</h2>

  <p>
    Our initial focus is on readers who play games on Android,
    particularly people using budget and mid-range devices.
    Our guides are intended to be useful whether someone is
    learning the basics or trying to solve a specific problem.
  </p>

  <h2>What we cover</h2>

  <ul>
    <li>
      Android gaming performance, optimisation and device behaviour.
    </li>
    <li>
      Game settings, configuration and compatibility.
    </li>
    <li>
      Troubleshooting and explanations of common problems.
    </li>
    <li>
      Practical, game-specific guides and tutorials.
    </li>
    <li>
      Relevant technology guidance that supports better gaming decisions.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we approach information</h2>

  <p>
    We aim to make technical information understandable without
    removing important details or limitations.
  </p>

  <p>
    We distinguish hands-on testing from research-based guidance,
    identify relevant device and software limitations, and avoid
    presenting unverified performance claims as measured results.
  </p>

  <p>
    We do not promise that a setting, tweak or recommendation will
    produce identical results on every device.
  </p>

  <h2>What LUDIVON is not</h2>

  <p>
    LUDIVON is an editorial publication. It is not a gaming forum,
    social network, application marketplace or general gaming-news
    aggregator.
  </p>

  <p>
    Our priority is useful, accurate and maintainable guidance
    rather than publishing content simply to increase article volume.
  </p>

  <h2>Our standards</h2>

  <p>
    Accuracy, transparency, clear explanations and reader trust
    guide our editorial approach.
  </p>

  <p>
    Read our
    <a href="/editorial-standards/">Editorial Standards</a>
    to understand how topics are researched, verified and published.
  </p>
</StaticPageLayout>